WEBVTT

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:06.690
<i>A moment in which a distinct reality was singled out</i>

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:09.570
<i>from the countless possible intertwined truths.</i>

00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:15.200
<i>That's what happened when Sakura Mai came to see me.</i>

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:19.620
Chemistry I/II

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:19.710
Chemistry I/II

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:21.750
Chemistry I/II

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:21.750
Is Maeda-senpai around?

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:23.750
Oh, it's Mai-chan.

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:26.720
Hey, isn't that Sakura Mai?

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:28.630
Yeah! It really <i>is</i> her!

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:33.110
The angel of rhythmic gymnastics has descended upon our humble class!

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:35.640
Chemistry I/II

00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:35.640
What business does she have with Maeda, though?

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:37.410
What's up, Mai-chan?

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:40.650
Senpai!

00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:42.800
I have a favor to ask.

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:43.770
Would you mind?

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:22.830
What's with the pork cutlet?

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:25.580
It's not just any old cutlet.

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:28.620
It's a special, extra-thick mille-feuille cutlet.

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:29.880
Right, so what about it?

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:34.100
You see, I actually really love fried foods.

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:36.090
But I'm on a diet, so...

00:02:36.730 --> 00:02:38.100
Oh, really?

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:39.340
Must be tough.

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:42.850
I haven't had a pork cutlet in years.

00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:47.330
That wonderful taste has disappeared to the far reaches of my memory...

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:53.100
But I remember really clearly that it's <i>really</i> good.

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:50.100
Three Years Ago

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:57.860
So please, eat this in my stead and tell me what you think!

00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:00.320
Wait, so your favor...

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:02.740
is for me to act like a restaurant reviewer?

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:03.600
Yes.

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:08.080
But I just finished a plate of cutlet curry a minute ago.

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:09.490
I don't think I could stomach it.

00:03:10.310 --> 00:03:11.740
I see.

00:03:11.740 --> 00:03:13.130
That's too bad.

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:15.500
Glad you understand.

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:16.880
Did you forget?

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:18.340
Huh? Forget what?

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:21.130
About those porn mags I'm holding onto for you.

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:28.900
I took a quick glimpse inside.

00:03:32.410 --> 00:03:33.860
They were <i>really</i> pervy.

00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:36.780
I got <i>so</i> embarrassed.

00:03:36.780 --> 00:03:38.860
You didn't have to read them!

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:41.860
But there were some pretty pictures too.

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:46.670
Some helped just a little in giving me a sense of what it means to be beautiful.

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:48.080
The others, not so much.

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:50.870
You didn't have to refer to them!

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:56.790
The Rhythmic Gymnastics Club wouldn't let you observe practices anymore if they found out you had those mags.

00:03:57.300 --> 00:04:01.020
Will you do me this favor, Senpai?

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:08.420
All right, here goes.

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:12.850
H-How is it?

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:14.650
It's great! The best!

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:17.110
That's it?

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:19.280
What else am I supposed to say?

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:21.690
Give me more details.

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:23.990
I can't do that.

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:25.740
Porn mags.

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:28.120
How is it?

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:31.160
It's great! The best!

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:34.500
All you did was say it louder.

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:36.630
More details please.

00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:38.920
So, another bowl.

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:42.010
Details, huh?

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:43.380
All right.

00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:53.680
The pork's natural juices gush out
from between its mille-feuille layers.

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:56.480
Yes, yes. What else?

00:04:56.480 --> 00:05:00.980
The egg, still runny, is perfect in its consistency and has blended harmoniously with the sweet and savory sauce.

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:05.450
Words cannot even begin to convey how delicious it is!

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:08.120
I can't stop eating!

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:12.870
Senpai, you're so cool!

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:14.750
You're so manly!

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:19.920
Mai-chan, you're drooling.

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:23.970
Oh, sorry. Was I really?

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:27.300
No, you weren't, but it looked like you were going to.

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:28.840
How embarrassing.

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:32.850
But now I remember how it tasted!

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:37.230
Now then, I'd better finish my cucumber and miso sandwich.

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:44.610
Senpai, that pork cutlet was just the beginning!

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:47.700
Desserts aren't really my thing...

00:05:48.090 --> 00:05:49.070
Porn mags.

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:51.010
M-My pleasure!

00:05:51.010 --> 00:05:55.040
H-Hang on, could you eat from the side with lots of chocolate?

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:55.900
Here?

00:05:55.900 --> 00:05:57.620
Yeah! Right there!

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:01.460
How is it?

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:02.800
It's great!

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:07.300
The bits of chocolate in the ice cream give it a nice crunch!

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:12.350
The texture is heavenly, and the
chocolate sauce is so rich and sweet!

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:14.960
Lick.

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:38.250
Did you get some good shots, Senpai?

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:39.170
Yeah.

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:42.340
Not to brag, but I think I'm getting better at this.

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:43.170
See?

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:53.930
M-Mai-chan?!

00:06:53.930 --> 00:06:55.680
I-I'm so sorry!

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:57.680
What's wrong?

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:58.770
Nothing, just...

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:02.190
Your arm suddenly looked like fried chicken...

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:05.980
Do you have to diet all the time for rhythmic gymnastics?

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:08.440
No, not all the time.

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:12.990
I just want to lose as much weight as I can before the fall competition.

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:14.030
Competition?

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:17.370
Yes. We'll be holding our own qualifiers for it soon.

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:22.830
I may not understand what beauty is,
but at least I can keep my figure pretty.

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:25.170
Sounds harsh.

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:27.000
I'm used to dieting.

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:28.050
I'll be fine.

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:31.550
Would you mind if I came to cheer for you?

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:33.550
Of course not! Please do!

00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:38.930
Cheering is the most I can do for you, after all.

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:41.440
Senpai...

00:08:10.070 --> 00:08:13.130
<i>And so, the day of the qualifiers came.</i>

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:24.920
Oh, no...

00:08:24.920 --> 00:08:27.150
I'm so nervous.

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:28.230
Don't worry.

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:29.780
I'll be right here cheering for you.

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:32.700
Thank you. I'll do my best.

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:34.220
Okay, off I go.

00:08:34.220 --> 00:08:35.160
Keep calm.

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:17.280
Mai! Pick it up!

00:09:18.530 --> 00:09:19.530
Okay!

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:36.340
Don't look down!

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:38.840
You can't look down!

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:40.720
Look straight ahead!

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:42.810
Don't give up until it's over!

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:46.310
Senpai...

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:07.040
Hang in there, Mai-chan!

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:25.810
All right.

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:26.850
Good job.

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:28.480
Mai-chan...

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:37.490
<i>Thank you, Senpai.</i>

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:56.170
Doesn't feel like a fever to me.

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:00.760
I'm sure I have one.

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:05.610
That's really cold!

00:11:05.610 --> 00:11:07.270
Quit fussing and sleep.

00:11:08.690 --> 00:11:09.730
Okay.

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:12.690
Hey, Niiyan.

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:14.690
Could you do me a favor?

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:15.980
What now?

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:19.780
Actually, I was gonna go to the pool with Mai-ryan tomorrow,

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:21.360
but I can't go when I'm sick.

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:23.820
You want me to go instead?

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:24.830
Yeah.

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:29.620
She's been kind of down since the qualifiers.

00:11:29.620 --> 00:11:32.580
I had practice so I didn't see what happened,

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:35.540
but I think a change of pace might help.

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:37.660
I see.

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:40.630
Mai-ryan was really excited to go,

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:43.680
so she'll be really sad if she doesn't get to.

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:45.600
I doubt she'd want me around, though.

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:48.140
Don't worry, she was super excited about it.

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:49.020
Huh?!

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:50.940
You told her I'd go?!

00:11:51.560 --> 00:11:53.650
Geez, at least ask me first.

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:56.520
In fact, she's probably more excited about going with you than me.

00:11:57.730 --> 00:12:00.320
You're looking pretty healthy for a sick person.

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:03.950
I'm still really sick...

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:32.980
Very nice, Mai-chan.

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:33.980
One more.

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:37.190
Whoa!

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:38.480
What the hell?!

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:39.900
What are you guys doing here?!

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:41.860
Isn't that obvious?

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:44.080
We're looking for photo opportunities!

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:47.950
Secretly keeping the angel of
rhythmic gymnastics all to yourself!

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:51.950
I won't forgive either of you if you
take any weird photos of Mai-chan!

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:53.370
What?!

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:57.380
Then where are we supposed to direct the flaming passions of our youth to?!

00:12:57.380 --> 00:13:00.130
Give those mags back now!

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:01.630
Okay, okay.

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:03.510
I'll give them back soon enough.

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:04.930
Excuse me!

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:08.180
Sorry, but could you get that ball for me?

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:12.260
Sure!

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:13.980
I'm picking it up!

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:15.270
No, I'm giving it to her!

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:16.440
No, she was talking to me!

00:13:16.440 --> 00:13:17.600
No, she wasn't!

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:19.190
Shut up! It's mine!

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:19.690
No way!

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:20.480
What'd you say?!

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:26.700
Sorry. Sorry.

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:30.370
I had fun today.

00:13:30.770 --> 00:13:32.790
I see. That's good.

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:39.380
Senpai, I ended up not qualifying for the fall competition.

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:41.880
Oh... The results are out?

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:44.630
Yes. I'll just have to accept it.

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:49.970
If I keep moping over my failure and looking down, I'll never find beauty.

00:13:50.550 --> 00:13:51.720
Mai-chan...

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:55.640
Kouga Private
Academy High
School

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:58.060
<i>We started going on more dates together after that.</i>

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:01.400
<i>Photography and rhythmic gymnastics.</i>

00:14:01.810 --> 00:14:05.150
<i>We work towards different things, but we seek the same beauty.</i>

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:13.080
<i>Every time I saw how hard and willingly she worked, it made me really want to take better photos.</i>

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:18.720
<i>And so, I immersed myself in taking photos every day.</i>

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:25.170
That's pretty amazing.

00:14:25.560 --> 00:14:28.010
It's research for next time.

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:29.180
I see.

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:33.140
But I think you need a breather once in a while.

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:56.750
What'd you need, Mai-chan?

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:58.130
Well...

00:14:58.130 --> 00:15:02.000
It just so happened that no one was
around, so I snuck them in your desk.

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:04.000
Snuck what?

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:06.260
Your porn mags.

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:13.260
Well then, make sure your classmates don't find them.

00:15:17.290 --> 00:15:19.090
A cram school envelope.

00:15:19.090 --> 00:15:20.690
Great idea, Mai-chan.

00:15:21.650 --> 00:15:22.560
What's this?

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:25.860
Maeda-senpai.

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:28.070
You're a perv, but I still love you!

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:29.220
Mai.

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:34.370
Looks like a love letter.

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:40.000
Please don't tell Nakagawa or Azuma!

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:44.000
A warrior's compassion.

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:46.550
Huh?

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:49.550
<i>And, one day...</i>

00:15:55.260 --> 00:15:56.890
Senpai.

00:15:56.890 --> 00:15:58.560
What's up, Mai-chan?

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:00.310
I'm waiting for Kano-chan.

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:02.940
Kanon isn't back yet?

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:03.900
Yes.

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:08.150
I forgot to return Kano-chan's Pretty Rabbie DVD, so...

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:09.150
I see.

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:10.570
So that's why you're here.

00:16:11.210 --> 00:16:12.820
Isn't it cold out here?

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:14.660
Come right on in.

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:16.070
Okay.

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:18.790
Put your bag down anywhere you want.

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:19.910
Okay.

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:25.080
But since Mom isn't around, it's probably not a good idea for us to be alone in this room.

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:26.210
Let's go back down.

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:29.540
We don't have to. I don't mind.

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:33.880
Your bed is so big, Senpai!

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:36.720
It's easily big enough for two people.

00:16:39.050 --> 00:16:41.230
I didn't mean it like that!

00:16:41.230 --> 00:16:42.810
Yeah, I know.

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:44.220
Have a seat.

00:16:44.220 --> 00:16:46.060
I'll go make some tea.

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:47.360
Sorry.

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:49.980
I'll sit down, then.

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:51.530
Oh, that's right!

00:16:52.790 --> 00:16:55.860
I wonder where you put those mags I gave back to you!

00:16:55.860 --> 00:17:00.620
I hear guys usually hide those things under their beds!

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:03.080
Time to take a look!

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:04.500
Hey, don't!

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:06.000
Why not?

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:10.000
Why not? Well, it's dirty and dusty...

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:11.910
Really?

00:17:11.910 --> 00:17:14.130
I bet there's stuff you don't want me to see!

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:15.970
That's not it!

00:17:23.230 --> 00:17:24.730
Senpai...

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:28.690
Senpai, your face is really close.

00:17:32.650 --> 00:17:35.030
M-Mai-chan...

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:43.540
I'm home!

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:46.330
Mai-ryan, sorry I'm late!

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:47.670
I got your message.

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:53.130
What happened?

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:55.000
Nothing.

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:04.890
<i>The moment when destined reality becomes truth.</i>

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:09.400
<i>That's what happened when
Sakura Mai came to see me again.</i>

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:09.650
Chemistry I/II

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:09.730
Chemistry I/II

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:14.530
Chemistry I/II

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:14.530
Senpai, I was chosen as an alternate for the team!

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:19.910
Sweet Potatoes

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:28.790
Sunsets are so pretty.

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:30.080
They really are.

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:36.170
I was recalling just now that time when I first met you.

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:37.640
Me too.

00:18:38.150 --> 00:18:40.430
So much has happened since then.

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:49.730
They're all such wonderful memories.

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:53.190
Mai-chan.

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:57.570
I think you gave me strength.

00:18:58.240 --> 00:18:59.350
Huh?

00:18:59.350 --> 00:19:03.830
Remember that time when you were practicing so hard all by yourself?

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:09.410
I saw that through the viewfinder and thought you were amazing.

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:14.670
I told myself that I'd have to work just as hard and take some great photos.

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:20.260
Maeda-senpai, you gave me strength too.

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:25.640
When you shouted to me not to give up during qualifiers,

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:27.720
I was really happy.

00:19:28.200 --> 00:19:31.730
You let me know that I wasn't alone.

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:33.980
My heart skipped a beat.

00:19:34.390 --> 00:19:37.640
You told me to look straight ahead and that we'd work hard together.

00:19:37.640 --> 00:19:38.820
Mai-chan...

00:19:39.690 --> 00:19:43.700
If only... I weren't so short.

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:49.870
Well, I'm the smallest person in the Rhythmic Gymnastics Club.

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:51.370
My chest, too...

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:57.750
You're more than attractive enough the way you are now.

00:19:59.170 --> 00:20:04.300
We can just seek our own visions of beauty from now on.

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:07.430
Without overreaching ourselves, and failing all along the way.

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:09.470
Senpai.

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:13.310
I'll work hard without overreaching myself, too.

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:15.810
I'll seek my own vision of beauty.

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:16.980
Good.

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:24.360
Could you stay by my side and cheer me on?

00:20:24.360 --> 00:20:25.410
Of course.

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:29.910
Thank you.

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:33.790
